WEBVTT

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:11.050
Man, I’m so bored!

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:13.610
Haven’t we gotten any orders
from Sakaki?

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:16.230
Not a word, meow.

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:20.580
In that case,
wanna do some training?

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.220
Let’s do it!

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:26.490
Vending machine, come on!

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:30.720
It’s not coming.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.650
‘Cause we’re indoors, meow.

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:37.640
Who’s that?

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:44.840
From here?!

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:52.980
Well done, meow!

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:56.080
Then let’s turn the wheel
like always!

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.480
Rocket Vending Secret!

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:06.200
Straight from HQ!

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:08.540
Some real kingly Pokémon,
come forth!

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:12.090
The Fish Pokémon,
Koiking!

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:15.340
The Royal Pokémon,
Yadoking!

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:18.670
Those sure are
some real kingly Pokémon, meow.

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:22.850
Let’s see,
and their moves are...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:24.230
Oh, my god!

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:25.750
W-What?

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:27.560
What’s it say, meow?

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:31.380
Today’s episode is a two-in-one!

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:34.030
”Flop! Koiking” and
“Crown Yourself! Yadoking”

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:35.810
Here we go!

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:37.410
Whoa!
An out-of-this-world bonus!

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:44.160
PocketMonsters

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:46.580
Hey, you still not ready? C'mon, hurry up!

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:49.160
You all packed and ready to leave?

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:51.880
I'll show you this wide mysterious world

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:54.750
And skip the slow send-off

00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:57.090
Be it through fire or through water

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:59.760
I'm fumbling blindly through the days

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:04.260
When I don't even know what the next second will bring

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:09.520
Each and every one of my memories

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:14.110
Can always be found inside a Ball

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:18.030
On 1, 2, 3, dive in!

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:23.780
I've got the future plans I imagined in my pocket

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:30.790
Greeting someone new is always fresh

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:35.000
No need (No need!) to hesitate! Try! (Try!)

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.340
Let's have a fight!

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:39.050
1: Once the battle's done

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:40.880
2: And we're laughing or crying

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:45.220
On 3, let's be friends!

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:51.890
Any day and every day, that's always been my rule

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:57.230
With this unpredictable, boundless world awaiting

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:59.730
Let's go! Every time you trip and fall

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:03.860
Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:05.660
I choose you!

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:11.170
Flop! Koiking

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:14.040
We’re the <i>Ko</i>-ings!

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:17.430
Go ahead and challenge me,
if you dare!

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:20.130
Flop, Goldking!

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:24.680
The tenth Koiking High Jump Tournament
has begun!

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:27.080
May your Koiking soar high, too!

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:31.100
Challenge the nine-time champion,
Kasuking’s Goldking!

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:33.510
We’re the <i>Ko</i>-ings!

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:36.480
You’re entering this?

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:40.780
Yeah! I’m aiming to win
with this guy!

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:43.450
Come out, Koiking!

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:50.810
Is this the Lord Koiking
from the other day?

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:52.490
He’s gotten crazy fat...

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:56.300
Don’t worry!
I got a master plan!

00:03:56.820 --> 00:03:58.170
We’re the <i>Ko</i>-ings!

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:01.300
Hope your abs are still ripped!

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:05.900
Kasuking isn’t <i>just</i> the
Koiking High Jump Champion.

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:08.390
He’s also a popular muscle trainer!

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:12.180
Now, don’t give up!
You can still do it!

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:14.650
Your abs can get
even more ripped!

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:19.110
Hey, Goldking!
Show ‘em your ripped muscles!

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:25.180
Kasuking really is an expert!

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:28.530
Hey, don’t you wanna be
as cool as Goldking?

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:31.090
You wanna beat Goldking, yeah?

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:34.760
Oh, you’re fired up?

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:37.350
All right!
Then we’ll train, too!

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:38.800
Right, Pikachu?

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:47.300
From that day on,

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:52.600
we were training fiercely
for the Koiking High Jump Tournament!

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:04.320
The sweat and tears shed
were countless!

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:12.120
Your greatest foe
is the weakness in your own heart!

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:19.340
The efforts piled up
to conquer this weakness...

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.960
...do not lie!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:26.840
We’ve done all we can,
yeah, Koiking?

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:31.320
We’re gonna win!

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:42.350
We’ve reached the semifinals
of the Koiking High Jump Tournament!

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:46.010
Contestant Go’s Koiking has
demonstrated some impressive jumps!

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:50.660
Its remarkable physique seems to have been
tailored with this tournament in mind!

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:56.000
His opponent is Koi Kingen,
last year’s runner-up!

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.250
Which of the two
will reach the finals?!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:04.060
Hang in there, Go!
You got this, Koiking!

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:09.800
Ready... Get set...
Jump!

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:11.440
Flop,

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:12.430
Koiking!

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:18.690
Off they go!
How will this turn out?!

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:20.270
Awesome!

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:33.050
21.02 meters!

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:35.410
Contestant Go wins,
beating his record in the process!

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:37.240
All right!

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:41.110
You’re in the finals
at last, Go!

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:43.810
Yeah! But next is...

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:46.560
The second match of the semifinals!

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:51.370
The nine-time champions,
the team of Kasuking and Goldking!

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:54.390
They are showing their
kingly dignity!

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:57.660
We’re the <i>Ko</i>-ings!

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:03.480
Ready... Get set...
Jump!

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.690
Flop, Goldking!

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:12.110
Incredible!

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:18.470
Champion Kasuking’s Goldking
displays immense power!

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:20.410
He makes it into the finals!

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:23.310
Onigori!

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:29.130
You got this, Go!

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:30.510
Of course!

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.680
I know this guy will pull through!

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:40.310
The Koiking High Jump Tournament
has reached the finals!

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:45.310
Contestant Go challenges
Kasuking for his crown!

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:49.820
You think you can
beat my Goldking?

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:52.070
That’s why I’m here.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:55.440
Then let me show you...

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:58.080
...the king’s true power!

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:03.450
Goldking has been restraining himself so far,
to liven up the tournament...

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:05.960
But this tournament will be
our tenth win in a row!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.960
Today, we will become legends!

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.970
Release all restraints,
and go at full power, Goldking!

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:19.250
Oh, my! Contestant Kasuking declares
that he hasn’t been serious until now!

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:22.230
What kind of jumps
can we expect?!

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:23.980
Scared?

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:26.110
No, I’m excited!

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:27.480
Really...

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:30.070
The Champion is something else,
all right.

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:31.880
Right, Koiking?

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:34.700
We couldn’t ask
for a better opponent!

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:38.030
Now it is time for you
to claim your wings!

00:08:39.940 --> 00:08:44.040
Oh, my! Contestant Go’s
Koiking’s fins...!

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:46.540
What is this?

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:50.420
My Koiking has been Flopping
with weights on all this time!

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:52.510
A stunning confession!

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:54.950
When’d he put <i>those</i> on...?

00:08:56.640 --> 00:09:01.300
Um, please wait a moment.
We are clearing the aren—

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:04.560
Kairiky injured its back!

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:08.480
Contestant Go’s Koiking has been equipped
with immensely heavy weights!

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:11.470
What kind of jumps
can we expect from <i>him?!</i>

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:15.400
The climactic High Jump
is about to take place!

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:18.660
Which Koiking will win?!

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:23.830
Ready... Get set...
Jump!

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:26.420
Flop, Goldking!

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:34.970
What’s this? Contestant Go’s Koiking
has yet to jump!

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:36.840
What could be wrong?!

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:40.340
Did you get scared
and throw the match?

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:41.430
Not at all.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:42.350
What?

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:45.790
My Koiking is still storing power...

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:48.230
...so that he can leap to <i>any</i> height!

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:54.400
Flop, Koiking!

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:02.790
Contestant Go’s Koiking
flies like a rocket!

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:15.420
My Goldking?!

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:18.510
Come on!

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:40.120
This is amazing!

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:41.700
What will the result be?!

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:46.700
I can’t believe I would lose...

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:49.290
He’s not coming back...

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:51.710
Huh?

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:54.410
Hello?

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:57.870
Excuse me...

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:03.260
The judge has just told me
his verdict.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.470
Verdict?

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:10.110
Um, since tournament rules state that
one’s results are only measured after <i>landing</i>,

00:11:10.110 --> 00:11:12.950
Contestant Go’s Koiking’s jump
will not get measured.

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:16.360
And as such, Contestant Kasuking’s
Goldking is the winner.

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:21.510
We’re the <i>Ko</i>-ings!

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:27.490
Unreliable... Pathetic...

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:28.290
Incredibly famous... Incredibly weak

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:29.870
Koiking...
Incredibly famous... Incredibly weak

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:30.920
Incredibly famous... Incredibly weak

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:31.960
He put so much blood, sweat and tears
into winning, and ultimately became a star...
Incredibly famous... Incredibly weak

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:35.940
Once upon a time it was super strong
He put so much blood, sweat and tears
into winning, and ultimately became a star...

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:36.590
I will never forget him.
Once upon a time it was super strong

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:37.570
Or so the rumors say, anyway
I will never forget him.

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:38.010
Or so the rumors say, anyway

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:40.380
Farewell, Koiking!
Thank you for the memories!
Or so the rumors say, anyway

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:40.950
Farewell, Koiking!
Thank you for the memories!

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:42.220
But now it’s really—
Farewell, Koiking!
Thank you for the memories!

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:45.020
Hey! Why are <i>you</i>
reciting the closing words?!

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:47.340
We’re the <i>Ko</i>-ings!

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:49.540
PocketMonsters

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:51.190
Pocket Monsters!
PocketMonsters

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:55.610
PocketMonsters

00:11:55.610 --> 00:12:00.530
Water
Koiking
PocketMonsters

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:06.030
Crown Yourself! Yadoking

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:20.330
Whoa... My info was right!

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:25.090
Yadon... Yadon...
and more Yadon!

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:46.890
What’cha doin’, Yadon?

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:53.610
What’cha doin’, Yadon?

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:57.330
Had a dream ‘bout wakin’ up with the sun

00:12:57.330 --> 00:13:00.840
As it slept ‘til noon, that Yadon

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:04.340
Its pink skin isn’t due to being overboiled

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:07.470
It always looked like that, that Yadon

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:13.430
Its large mouth is like a convenience store;
Open 24/7

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:17.600
Yadon! Dopey Pokémon!
Water/Psychic type!

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:19.860
Its long tail often breaks off!

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:23.980
It doesn’t really feel any pain, though, and the tail
grows back, so Yadon isn’t particularly bothered!

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:26.370
Its tail is said to be sweet!

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:28.930
Its tail, huh...?

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:30.280
I wonder if it tastes nice.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:31.490
Delicious!

00:13:35.990 --> 00:13:37.640
What are you doing?

00:13:37.640 --> 00:13:39.570
Well, I was just hungry.

00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:42.980
Come on... We’re all the way out
on the Yadon island.

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:44.850
At least <i>act</i> like you’re in awe.

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:46.220
I <i>am</i>, though!

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:48.890
Whatever.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:51.480
Time to catch a Yadon.

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:54.700
Which one should I get...?

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:04.900
Is that...?

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:08.600
Udon!

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:10.650
Not the <i>food!</i>

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:16.380
Yadoking! Royal Pokémon!
Water/Psychic type!

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:21.340
If its tail is bitten by a Shellder,
Yadon evolves into Yadoran!

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:24.780
But when its head is bitten instead,
it evolves into Yadoking!

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:27.340
It possesses the
intellect of a genius!

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:29.840
Huh? Of a genius?

00:14:33.340 --> 00:14:36.310
All right!
I’ll start with Yadoking!

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:43.880
That’s Psychokinesis!

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:56.040
You want this? Sure.

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:37.840
I know, right? It’s great!

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:46.790
It came off?!

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:55.680
What?!

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:59.330
Satoshi, are you okay?

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:01.150
<i>No problem!</i>

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:06.610
<i>I’m excellent!</i>

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:10.090
<i>Understand?</i>

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:13.040
Satoshi...
You’re acting kinda weird.

00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:15.630
Weird?

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:17.990
Why, I haven’t the faintest clue
what you mean!

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:20.860
I am Satoshi. No...

00:16:20.860 --> 00:16:24.000
I am Satoking!
I have become a Yadon Master!

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:27.250
An influencer striving
to improve the Yadon!

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:30.100
No, this is totally weird, yeah?

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:32.840
Could that thing be why?

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:35.000
All right...

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:40.730
Cease that, my dear Go.
That would be a severe compliance breach.

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:44.380
W-What is that?!
Look, just take that thing off your head!

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:47.860
I cannot do that!
I need it to remain myself.

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:51.860
This is a critical factor to
the Yadon’s future success!

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:54.610
A most big issue for us!

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:57.950
I don’t understand you at all!

00:16:57.950 --> 00:17:03.250
It appears, my dear Go, that you cannot comprehend
the success I am attempting to reach.

00:17:04.180 --> 00:17:06.520
I have to put Satoshi
back to normal!

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:09.630
Rabbifoot, use Double Kick
on that thing on Satoshi’s head!

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.670
Pikachu, help us!

00:17:18.670 --> 00:17:20.000
100,000 Volts!

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:26.690
Stop, my dear Pikachu.

00:17:32.390 --> 00:17:36.000
It takes a bit of time
for Yadon to feel pain!

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:41.070
You and the Yadon
are both part of my beloved family.

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:45.210
There is no reason whatsoever
for there to be any conflict between us. Be at ease!

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:48.920
Satoshi...

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:53.010
My dear Go,
will you not walk alongside me?

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:57.650
The synergy between you and I
shall surely point the Yadon’s future in a positive direction!

00:17:57.650 --> 00:17:59.190
There’s no way!

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:00.930
Welcome, my Yadokingdom!

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:03.100
I absolutely refuse!

00:18:07.490 --> 00:18:09.220
What are you trying to do?!

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:12.480
Here you are, my dear Go.
As of today, you shall be a Yadoran.

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:19.280
Never! You’re gonna be
a Pokémon Master, right?

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:22.910
I am now the Yadon Master,
Satoking!

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:30.130
Double Kick!

00:18:38.820 --> 00:18:40.510
Huh? What am I doing?

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:42.220
All right! You’re back to—

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:44.630
Go!

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:51.270
My name is Goking!
I shall capture every Yadon!

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.910
What’s happened to you, Go?

00:18:58.550 --> 00:19:00.070
Huh? What was I doing?

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:04.950
Pikachu!

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:20.130
Pikachu!

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:21.850
Rabbifoot?!

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:33.720
<i>Compliance!</i>

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:36.860
I shall capture them!

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:46.330
<i>Critical success factor!</i>

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:49.920
<i>Complete!</i>

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:52.870
